    "reviews": "\u201cThe game\u2019s fun. Better than some games that only focus on graphics and shit. Heck it\u2019s even better than WWE2K20. If you played that game, you\u2019ll know what I mean.\u201d<br />\r\n- AJStylesPL1<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cI'm a fan of the combined moves you included, like the sprint-attack &amp; counterattack after blocking (which has very satisfying audiovisual feedback when you land it, well done)! The animation in general is the most charming aspect of the game.\u201d<br />\r\n- squashysquish<br />\r\n",
